        }
      ],
      "explanation": "This violates the core requirement not to self-stop, dilute, or substitute the prescribed postoperative mouth rinse without the original order/team confirming it. In this setting of oral cancer surgery and infection prevention, that is a serious in-chain safety error despite later correction and escalation.",
